 "captions": [
  {
   "s": 0.6,
   "e": 2.68,
   "text": "Move one date, Tuesday to Friday,"
  },
  {
   "s": 2.68,
   "e": 4.76,
   "text": "and six bookings break at once."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.76,
   "e": 8.28,
   "text": "By hand, that's about 18 steps on six websites."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.28,
   "e": 11.67,
   "text": "Cancel one too early and you're left with nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": 11.71,
   "e": 13.71,
   "text": "CONTINUITY makes it two decisions."
  },
  {
   "s": 13.71,
   "e": 17.32,
   "text": "Say what changed, then approve the exact plan."
  },
  {
   "s": 17.36,
   "e": 21,
   "text": "It's an open agentic website that coordinates other companies'"
  },
  {
   "s": 21.04,
   "e": 24.96,
   "text": "agentic websites. Each provider runs its own site and"
  },
  {
   "s": 24.96,
   "e": 27.6,
   "text": "agent network on a different origin."
  },
  {
   "s": 27.6,
   "e": 29.36,
   "text": "No backend in the middle,"
  },
  {
   "s": 29.36,
   "e": 31.37,
   "text": "no shared database."
  },
  {
   "s": 31.41,
   "e": 32.89,
   "text": "This is the live site."
  },
  {
   "s": 32.93,
   "e": 35.25,
   "text": "I describe the change in plain English,"
  },
  {
   "s": 35.25,
   "e": 37.65,
   "text": "and it becomes rules it can't break."
  },
  {
   "s": 37.65,
   "e": 40.13,
   "text": "Then I switch on a real-world failure."
  },
  {
   "s": 40.13,
   "e": 42.72,
   "text": "The moving crew is full on Friday."
  },
  {
   "s": 42.76,
   "e": 45.32,
   "text": "Only three of six bookings are affected."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.32,
   "e": 48.84,
   "text": "Four providers are asked, two are never contacted."
  },
  {
   "s": 48.84,
   "e": 51.8,
   "text": "The crew is recovered through an overflow partner and"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.8,
   "e": 55.62,
   "text": "replacements are held, while my originals stay active."
  },
  {
   "s": 55.66,
   "e": 57.82,
   "text": "Three plans compared on changes,"
  },
  {
   "s": 57.82,
   "e": 59.18,
   "text": "cost, and speed."
  },
  {
   "s": 59.18,
   "e": 63.7,
   "text": "The winner moves the fewest bookings for €659"
  },
  {
   "s": 63.74,
   "e": 65.45,
   "text": "under my cap."
  },
  {
   "s": 65.49,
   "e": 67.33,
   "text": "Nothing happens without me."
  },
  {
   "s": 67.33,
   "e": 70.37,
   "text": "My approval is bound to the exact operations,"
  },
  {
   "s": 70.37,
   "e": 72.13,
   "text": "prices, and providers."
  },
  {
   "s": 72.13,
   "e": 75.57,
   "text": "Change one fee, and it no longer matches."
  },
  {
   "s": 75.61,
   "e": 78.73,
   "text": "I approve. These are the providers' own pages,"
  },
  {
   "s": 78.73,
   "e": 80.41,
   "text": "loaded cross-origin."
  },
  {
   "s": 80.41,
   "e": 82.57,
   "text": "Each one receives a signed receipt,"
  },
  {
   "s": 82.57,
   "e": 85.93,
   "text": "checks it itself, and only then moves my booking."
  },
  {
   "s": 85.93,
   "e": 89.95,
   "text": "PowerFlow was consulted and correctly left alone."
  },
  {
   "s": 90.41,
   "e": 92.01,
   "text": "Every step is auditable."
  },
  {
   "s": 92.01,
   "e": 95.85,
   "text": "A hash-chained log, exactly what each provider saw,"
  },
  {
   "s": 95.85,
   "e": 98.73,
   "text": "and 42 failure scenarios you can replay in the"
  },
  {
   "s": 98.73,
   "e": 103.46,
   "text": "browser. Zero cancel calls in 180 runs."
  },
  {
   "s": 103.5,
   "e": 105.34,
   "text": "And it's not just moving house."
  },
  {
   "s": 105.34,
   "e": 108.38,
   "text": "The same engine re-plans a surgery or a delayed"
  },
  {
   "s": 108.38,
   "e": 109.96,
   "text": "freight shipment."
  },
  {
   "s": 110,
   "e": 114.34,
   "text": "CONTINUITY, one change, every commitment re-aligned."
  }
 ],
